      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is literally way too much work to even get the impostors work. Their main point is just to show the avatar, nothing else. If you want you want your avatar to show on your platform when playing on it, upload the avatar for it. This will introduce so many bugs and probably avatar breaking features, this is a  bad idea. Upload your avatar on the platform you want to play it on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
